the floodgates to nuclear activity?

00:09:50.523 --> 00:09:52.058
Very possibly

00:09:52.058 --> 00:09:53.292
in the middle of a war zone?

00:09:53.292 --> 00:09:54.060
And there's shelling

00:09:54.060 --> 00:09:55.561
coming from both sides.

00:09:55.561 --> 00:09:56.929
And there are a lot of parts

00:09:56.929 --> 00:09:57.763
of that nuclear

00:09:57.763 --> 00:09:58.831
reactor complex

00:09:58.831 --> 00:10:00.166
that could, in fact, be vulnerable

00:10:00.166 --> 00:10:01.701
to the shelling.

00:10:01.701 --> 00:10:03.769
Radioactive material could be leaked out.

00:10:03.769 --> 00:10:05.972
But also, Russia has been waiving

00:10:05.972 --> 00:10:07.306
that nuclear saber

00:10:07.306 --> 00:10:08.674
over the past several months

00:10:08.674 --> 00:10:09.775
and saying that the Ukrainians

00:10:09.775 --> 00:10:10.309
were going to use

00:10:10.309 --> 00:10:13.012
some type of dirty bomb as a pretext

00:10:13.679 --> 00:10:15.181
for escalation.

00:10:15.181 --> 00:10:17.216
So I am concerned that the rhetoric now

00:10:17.216 --> 00:10:17.783
once again

00:10:17.783 --> 00:10:18.384
is focusing

00:10:18.384 --> 00:10:20.953
on the nuclear reactor plant in freezer.

00:10:20.953 --> 00:10:22.054
The fighting around

00:10:22.054 --> 00:10:23.889
the area is increasing,

00:10:23.889 --> 00:10:25.791
which means that the what has been

00:10:25.791 --> 00:10:28.194
the largest nuclear plant in Europe

00:10:28.194 --> 00:10:28.861
could, in fact,

00:10:28.861 --> 00:10:29.595
be the site

00:10:29.595 --> 00:10:32.131
of a devastating nuclear disaster

00:10:32.398 --> 00:10:32.798
that could have

00:10:32.798 --> 00:10:34.000
far reaching implications.

00:10:34.000 --> 00:10:34.467
Hopefully,

00:10:34.467 --> 00:10:34.967
the reactors are

00:10:34.967 --> 00:10:36.202
not going to be breached.

00:10:36.202 --> 00:10:37.436
But given the light,

00:10:37.436 --> 00:10:38.137
the fighting that's going

00:10:38.137 --> 00:10:38.771
on, given

00:10:38.771 --> 00:10:39.372
the fact that

00:10:39.372 --> 00:10:40.439
some of the electric power

00:10:40.439 --> 00:10:42.541
going to the complex is being cut off,

00:10:42.541 --> 00:10:44.577
and you need to maintain that electricity

00:10:44.577 --> 00:10:44.777
in order

00:10:44.777 --> 00:10:46.512
to keep those cooling systems running.

00:10:46.512 --> 00:10:48.247
So it is at a very worrisome stage

00:10:48.247 --> 00:10:49.882
in terms of where that reactor so

00:10:49.882 --> 00:10:50.583
future stands.

